 "note": "Included (complete per Spellbook) combos are identical in baseline and candidate: Malcolm, Keen-Eyed Navigator + Glint-Horn Buccaneer (near-infinite damage; needs two or more opponents damaged per loop and Glint-Horn attacking), and five Time Sieve lines (Edward, Hoard Hauler, The Reaver Cleaver, Luxurious Locomotive, Malcolm+Academy Manufactor) that Spellbook labels infinite/near-infinite turns. Those Sieve lines are NOT unconditional infinites: each extra turn needs five artifacts to sacrifice and enough Treasure regeneration (combat connection or tapped qualifiers) on every loop; this review treats them as repeatable extra-turn engines, not deterministic infinites. Almost-included counts 43 (baseline) vs 45 (candidate); no new complete combo is introduced by the five adds."
